@host = http://localhost:8080
@groupId = 1
@historyBeforeId = 100

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Restaurant state
GET {{host}}/api/restaurant

### History page (use nextHistoryBeforeId)
GET {{host}}/api/restaurant?historyBeforeId={{historyBeforeId}}

### Add table
POST {{host}}/api/tables
Content-Type: application/json

{"capacity": 4}

### Add group (not idempotent)
POST {{host}}/api/groups
Content-Type: application/json

{"size": 2}

### Leave queue (Waiting only)
POST {{host}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/leave

### Complete visit (Seated only)
POST {{host}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/complete
